<section aria-labelledby="cli-examples-heading">
  <h2 id="cli-examples-heading">CLI examples</h2>
  <pre><code># Add an entry using the hidden Secret prompt
d2fa add

# Generate a code
d2fa code GitHub --copy

# List entries with indices
d2fa list --indices

# Output for scripts
d2fa code GitHub --json
d2fa code GitHub --raw

# Create an encrypted backup
d2fa backup</code></pre>
  <p>See the <a href="/docs/cli">CLI reference</a> for vault options and other commands.</p>
</section>